# Maven Central answers 429 (too many requests) to busy CI runners. Retry those and other
# transient download failures longer than Maven's default of 3 tries 5 s apart: 6 tries, waiting
# 10 s, 20 s, ... 60 s, unless the server sends Retry-After.
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.count=6
-Daether.connector.http.retryHandler.interval=10000
